--- !u!114 &3961139303580722996
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 464778666437664048}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b7478142301fd1b9c83932081dad4a48, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "AH. Woah, ok, crazy real dream\u2026it\u2019s like that car really hit me\u2026"
  - "But I know it was just a dream, because I wouldn\u2019t ever let someone hit
    me."
  - "I\u2019d swerve out of the way like I\u2019m fast and-"
  - Wait.
  - "Didn\u2019t I feel like this before?"
  - "The past three days, including today, I\u2019ve woken up with a raging headache,
    and I keep having this car dream\u2026what is going on?"
  - 'Am I in some sort of-

'
  - Wait.
  - I have work!
  - "Where is my watch? Oh no, no no no! If I don\u2019t have my watch, I can\u2019t
    tell the time!"
  - And more importantly, I lose all my class! No! My style, my swag! Where could
    it be, I need to find it or-
  - Wait.
  - "It\u2019s on my arm. Silly me. I almost thought I had lost-"
  - Wait.
  - "Work is in three minutes?!?! I\u2019m gonna be late!"
  - "Please, I can\u2019t take any more mean coffee bean drenching in front of all
    my co-workers!"
  - "My life will be ruined. And my nice white shirt I totally don\u2019t have five
    more of! I gotta go!\n"
