  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b7478142301fd1b9c83932081dad4a48, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - Ah, what another lovely day to roam among the living!
  - "Last night sure left me with a raging headache, but it\u2019ll blow over!"
  - "I can\u2019t wait to lay around and crack open some-\nWait a minute. I have
    work! In uh\u2026three minutes?!?!?"
  - 'I better get out the door! Last time I was late, my boss threw coffee at me!
    That was so embarrassing, I need to go!

'
