  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b7478142301fd1b9c83932081dad4a48, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "My head\u2026ugh\u2026what a weird dream."
  - "It felt like I actually got hit by a car\u2026I think I went a little too crazy
    last night with the partying.\n"
  - Wait.
  - "Didn\u2019t I feel like that yesterday when I woke up? Oh well. Time to enjoy
    my day-"
  - Wait.
  - I have work! In uh, lets see here. How does a watch work again?
  - "Hour hand, minute hand, second hand, oh right! So the minute hand is on the\u202627???"
  - 'I have 3 minutes?!?!? I gotta go, or else my boss will submit me to coffee torture!

'
